  "synopsis": "It tells the story of the heroine Tao Mengyan who returned to the mysterious village of Zangling in her dream to find the truth in order to resolve her nightmare. The village still retains the strange custom of worshiping \"paper brides\". Tao Mengyan, who was chosen as the \"paper bride\", experienced a life-and-death experience in Zangling Village, and finally solved the mystery of her past life and learned the thousand-year-old historical truth of the \"Zangzun\" belief in Zangling Village.\n\n(Source: Tencent, translated)",
